Package: gnome-settings-daemon
Version: @DEB_GSD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-settings-daemon
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libglib2.0-bin, libgtk-3-0, libgnome-desktop-4-2, gsettings-desktop-schemas, libnotify4, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, libpulse0, dbus, libgtkintl, libx11-6
Description: GNOME settings daemon (minimal) for the Xios desktop
 A minimal gnome-settings-daemon 46 for rootless iOS. Only the plugins that
 apply to a Wayland tablet are built: a11y-settings, housekeeping, keyboard and
 screensaver-proxy. The hardware/service plugins (power, color, datetime,
 media-keys, sound, xsettings, sharing, print, rfkill, wwan, smartcard, wacom,
 usb-protection) are dropped because iOS has no matching hardware, no systemd/
 logind and no X11 display in the Wayland session. Started as child components by
 gnome-session (classic path). See docs/gnome-session-plan.md.
